  "full_text": "When I saw the videos, sometimes my eyes went dim when I said that I started taking the pills. And then I got to thinking, what if Google AMP shows like predator, prey, people with blue eyes can see, people with blue eyes can see shit, people with brown eyes cannot. Maybe it's not a matter of resolution, but perception. And then, so like, then... I accidentally brought up the point of hitting a bad note. What if people with brown eyes have better hearing? It's kind of, well, anyway. So, like, perception. And then, like, Diana's, I got an email that said, where it called me honey, honey, and I was thinking, no, I don't want to be called honey. That is not what I want to be called. We can call me tear. And, anyway, so, like, Terminators didn't know what to, didn't know how to interact. In fact, Diana is not similar to me, perhaps. Anyway, so...",
